        <article class="hero-section__content">
            <div class="hero-section__content-header">
                {{> c-approved-by secondary=true custom="Backed by <strong>Skin Experts</strong>" }}
                <h1>Visibly reduce the appearance of wrinkles and dark spots - without injectables.</h1>
                <p><strong>24K gold-plated microneedles</strong> deliver <strong>targeted serums</strong> beyond your skin's barrier where traditional creams can't reach.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-section__content-button">
                {{!-- <div class="c-info-bar c-info-bar--alert c-info-bar--fill"><strong>Limited Time Offer:</strong> Less than one clinic visit.</div> --}}
